will of, of people.

00:03:57.555 --> 00:03:58.330
&gt;&gt; Mm-hm.

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:00.100
&gt;&gt; Of these million.

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:01.334
&gt;&gt; Ordinary, ordinary.

00:04:01.334 --> 00:04:03.955
&gt;&gt; Million of wills of ordinary people.

