happens.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:13.640
And he wants a compelling storyline that
has a beginning,

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:17.520
a, a critical moment of choice and then a
[UNKNOWN] and

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:21.380
