now I understand what happened and why.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:24.375
And it's, it's coherent inside itself.

00:06:24.375 --> 00:06:26.467
[SOUND].

00:06:26.467 --> 00:06:29.225
&gt;&gt; This quest for coherence leads nations
to

00:06:29.225 --> 00:06:33.020
