[UNKNOWN] by [UNKNOWN],

00:06:40.084 --> 00:06:48.625
one of the major Russian military leaders
in the battles described in War and Peace.

00:06:48.625 --> 00:06:49.540
&gt;&gt; [INAUDIBLE]

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:53.530
&gt;&gt; He's represented here in a classic
heroic pose.

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:58.660
The basic message of War and Peace is the
such heroic portrayals and

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:03.470
their implicit characterization of
leadership as important in history,

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:06.240
is fundamentally nonsense.

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:11.260
They tell a good and familiar story, but
they do not describe reality.

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:16.780
&gt;&gt; Our history is inextricable the
distortion of the past.

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:19.440
And it's the issues that we are concerned
with today.

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:24.220
We go back and choose narratives to
explore.

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:26.934
History is politics projected into the
past.

00:07:26.934 --> 00:07:32.297
[MUSIC]

00:07:32.297 --> 00:07:35.410
&gt;&gt; Heroic stories of leadership are
standard.

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:37.782
