00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:33.110
&gt;&gt; Yes.
&gt;&gt; In Manilla,

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.920
the United States Military Commission
hears the final witness in

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:38.740
the trial of Japanese General [UNKNOWN]
[UNKNOWN].

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:43.150
&gt;&gt; Is the villan, as much a myth as the
hero?

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:47.020
&gt;&gt; Madame Homma takes the stand to defend
her husband,

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:50.430
