00:09:34.696 --> 00:09:36.890
Such stories are universal.

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:42.220
&gt;&gt; But so also is skepticism about them.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:47.370
War and Peace argues that leadership is a
myth by which both leaders and

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:52.695
